        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI3XbGJBXE9n80n_alIZF77C_gKcRpjOEC8YKMVcHT3vVZxSg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Today was my first appointment at this clinic. Warm and friendly approach, staff very nice and accomodating, the dental hygienist Melissa was absolutely wonderful  and cleaning my very sensitive teeth, which was expected to be an uncomfortable procedure , proved to be fun an completely painless. Dr Sabrina Bouferguene also very warm, professional and caring. Really pleased!",
        "time": 1763664646,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Victoria Adams",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110903110269900357162/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXN2bfjxdhh_lLm5_GtaFEs6p4mHD95h_9PO6IQoU5MjRIWKIo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Today was my first appointment at this dental clinic. Melissa, the hygienist is SO warm and friendly! She made me feel so comfortable from the moment we met. It was like having my best friend clean my teeth and take x-rays! The dentist is just as nice and so is the secretary! I absolutely recommend this dental clinic!",
        "time": 1700703389,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Crystal",
